<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 68,631.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 68,631.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 25 totaled 68,631 bales, up from 67,821 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 792 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 6,501 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640</p>
